     "content_html": "British parliament was so moved by the Captain’s words that it ordered his troops to escort the funeral for those unfairly slain."
    },
    {
     "id": 1167813,
     "content_html": "Patriots used the event to galvanize citizens by producing images and rhetoric."
    },
    {
